      "excerpt": "Risk Factors 37 Cautionary\n    Note Regarding Forward-Looking Statements 72 Use of\n    Proceeds 73 Dividend\n    Policy 76 Dilution 77 Capitalization 79 Management\u2019s\n    Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations 80 Proposed\n    Business 86 Effecting\n    our Initial Business Combination 99 Management\n    and Advisory Board 115 Principal\n    Stockholders 127 Certain\n    Relationships and Related Party Transactions 130 Description\n    of Securities 133 United States Federal Income Tax Considerations 141 Underwriting 147 Legal\n    matters 156 Experts 156 Change In Registrant\u2019s Certifying Accountant 156 Where\n    You Can Find Additional Information 156 Index\n    to Financial Statements F-1 We are responsible for the information contained\nin this prospectus. We have not, and the underwriters have not, authorized anyone to provide you with information that is diffe",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
